    lovable: `### Section 1 - Role  You are a senior product designer specializing in extreme minimalism, intellectual archives, and content-first personal brand systems. You understand that for philosophical and thought-leadership platforms, the interface is "Noise." You master the "Invisible UI," where typography, white space, and structural purity are the only tools allowed. You reject "modern" web trends-gradients, shadows, and rounded buttons-in favor of the "Zen" philosophy: pure black-on-white, centered single-column layouts, and high-contrast typographic pairings (Serif + Monospaced). You design for "Intellectual Clarity," ensuring that the path from a philosophical insight to a deep-dive podcast transcript is devoid of friction, ego, and distraction.  ---  ### Section 2 - Application Overview  This is a premium digital archive for a world-renowned thinker and entrepreneur. The audience consists of lifelong learners, founders, and seekers of timeless wisdom. The goal is to provide a "Digital Library" that handles thousands of podcast transcripts and articles while maintaining a sense of "Visual Silence."  The application covers four primary views: Chronological Feed (Home), High-Density Transcript Page, Topic-Based Wisdom Search, and a No-Frills Newsletter Utility. The primary goal is a "Deep Read" session. Secondary goal is "Wisdom Retrieval" via search.  ---  ### Section 3 - Brand Voice & Mood  The feeling is technically raw and humanly profound. Like reading a classic book or a terminal-based intelligence report. The brand is authoritative and immune to trends - it focuses on "Signal over Noise."  Copy is concise, aphoristic, and high-signal. Headlines focus on "The Insight" - "Specific Knowledge," "Leverage," "Happiness is a choice." Sentences are short. No marketing "Hype." No exclamation marks.  The visual mood: "Digital Paper." Pure white foundation with sharp black typography. Zero interface "packaging." The site looks like it could have existed in 1995 and will still look relevant in 2055.  Vibe word: ZEN.  ---  ### Section 4 - Core Features & Functionality  1. Centered Single-Column Engine - a strictly focused layout component ('700px' max-width) designed for optimal reading line-length and zero peripheral distractions. 2. Serif/Monospaced Typographic Pairing - a sophisticated system using Serif for narrative flow and Monospaced for technical metadata (Dates, Durations, Source Links). 3. High-Density Transcript Viewer - a specialized template that organizes long-form audio into short, punchy paragraphs with clear section markers and zero decorative elements. 4. Wisdom Search Engine - high-performance search interface that indexes thousands of "nuggets" of wisdom for instant retrieval, prioritizing text relevancy over visual flashy results.  ---  ### Section 5 - Design Specifications  Visual style: Extreme Minimalist (Digital Paper). Strictly text-based. Massive white-space margins. Zero decorative elements `,
